clear
units real
atom_style full
read_data interface.data
pair_style lj/cut/coul/long 12.0
kspace_style pppm 1.0e-4
pair_modify mix arithmetic
pair_coeff 1 1 0.240000 4.200000
pair_coeff 1 2 0.380000 4.000000
pair_coeff 1 3 0.520000 3.750000
pair_coeff 1 4 0.480000 3.600000
pair_coeff 1 5 0.300000 3.650000
pair_coeff 1 6 0.140000 3.500000
pair_coeff 2 2 0.340000 3.800000
pair_coeff 2 3 0.432435 3.550000
pair_coeff 2 4 0.560000 3.400000
pair_coeff 2 5 0.420000 3.450000
pair_coeff 2 6 0.200000 3.200000
pair_coeff 3 3 0.550000 3.300000
pair_coeff 3 4 0.960000 3.150000
pair_coeff 3 5 0.640000 3.200000
pair_coeff 3 6 0.280000 3.050000
pair_coeff 4 4 0.180000 3.000000
pair_coeff 4 5 0.200000 3.050000
pair_coeff 4 6 0.120000 2.900000
pair_coeff 5 5 0.160000 3.100000
pair_coeff 5 6 0.126491 2.950000
pair_coeff 6 6 0.100000 2.800000
bond_style harmonic
bond_coeff 1 12.000000 4.200000
bond_coeff 2 18.000000 1.350000
bond_coeff 3 24.640000 2.350000
bond_coeff 4 40.000000 2.150000
bond_coeff 5 8.000000 2.150000
neighbor 2.0 bin
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp pe etotal vol press
fix ensemble all npt temp 300.0 300.0 100.0 iso 1.0 1.0 1000.0
run 100000
